{"ts": 1791259962.882008, "type": "step", "step": 27, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "The quiz miss means we should make this concrete. Think of 3 runs with outcomes S/F.\n- pass@3 = 1 if at least one run is S\n- pass^3 = 1 only if all three runs are S\n\nSo:\n- S S F  -> pass@3 = 1, pass^3 = 0\n- F F S  -> pass@3 = 1, pass^3 = 0\n- S S S  -> pass@3 = 1, pass^3 = 1\n\nReply with which metric is stricter and why in 1 short sentence. Then we\u2019ll turn that into your eval wording.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=17 messages 4m", "t": 21, "activity": [{"t": 17, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.6328670195584893}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7409758501679254, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.4960277029846047, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259965.4694028, "type": "step", "step": 28, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Next: turn the idea into your writeup and make sure you can explain it yourself. Write these in your draft:\n1) one-run success criterion,\n2) the 3 seeds you used,\n3) one sentence: \u201cWe report pass^3, so the agent only passes if all three seeded runs succeed.\u201d\n4) one contrast sentence: \u201cThis is stricter than pass@3, which only requires at least one successful run.\u201d\n\nAfter you add that, reply with your one-run success criterion and I\u2019ll check it. If you want, I can also quiz you once more after you draft it.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3_eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=21 messages 2m", "t": 23, "activity": [{"t": 21, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.6657155630213342}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7409758501679254, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.5160277029846047, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
